  "content": "<h1>由Coffee制作的简约PBR材质包</h1><h2>该材质包目前处于早期开发阶段，已覆盖约300个方块。</h2><p><strong>要求：</strong></p><p><strong><em>OptiFine 或 Iris Shaders</em></strong></p><p><em><strong>请确保你的光影支持LabPBR</strong></em></p><p><em><strong>支持PBR功能的材质包，例如Nostalgia Shaders、BSL Shaders或Kappa Shaders。</strong></em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><em><strong>如果你喜欢我制作的材质包，可以考虑赞助我买杯饮料，支持CoffeePBR材质包的长期更新。你可以在<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fifdian.net%252fa%252fCoffeeXiaoGuan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">爱发电</a>上赞助我</strong></em></h2><h1><em><strong>希望大家喜欢我的材质包</strong></em></h1><p><em><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_8540790b-ece9-4836-8167-c4e958238f1a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"455\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_71ea77b4-ee21-4214-b413-2ee7b44ec729.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"455\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_45bcbfd9-8ac1-4b3e-b687-89b1e6b628f6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"455\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b9f8eb26-8c3b-42cc-bec0-48cac661c730.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_9560c0a3-b1c8-4d40-acba-2cda351e175f.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></em></p>",
